  "goodToKnow": "Die Individualität is individuality: die eigene Individualität ausdrücken, Individualität und Gemeinschaft. Individuell means individual or personal: individuelle Beratung (personal advice). Das Individuum (plural Individuen) is the individual. German Romanticism and philosophers like Wilhelm von Humboldt stressed developing one's individuality through education (Bildung). It has no plural."
